WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.739
Identify farming activities and tools

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:09.318
Crop: a plant grown to be eaten or sold. Seedling: a young plant that has begun to

00:00:09.318 --> 00:00:09.619
grow.

00:00:10.450 --> 00:00:15.437
Transplanting: moving a young plant carefully into a new growing place. Compost:

00:00:15.437 --> 00:00:20.425
decayed organic matter that improves soil. Farm record: notes about plant growth,

00:00:20.425 --> 00:00:21.671
costs or harvests.

00:00:22.533 --> 00:00:27.504
Grow one seed safely in a reused container and record its changes for ten days.
